                                        "entry_id": "20707cf2-8ead-31e1-85a1-a0185b4f8691",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An antisubmarine rocket used mainly during World War II by the US Navy and US Coast Guard."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "historical",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b917084-6101-46ce-a8f6-b3a38587ed62",
                                                "sense_id": "ffcfbb7c-92af-31a7-b4ef-001d389e98c9",
                                                "text": "Besides depth charges, they were armed with smaller forward firing antisubmarine rocket launchers called mousetraps. Fired in groups, these rockets detonated when they contacted a submarine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
